Well, if she gets lost again, you know where to find her.

173
00:07:13,720 --> 00:07:15,380
她过去几个月
She's been hanging around outside our window

174
00:07:15,380 --> 00:07:16,760
天天都在在我家窗外晃悠
every day for the last couple of months.

175
00:07:16,800 --> 00:07:18,198
所以我让她进门了 希望你们不介意
So I let her in. I hope that's okay.

176
00:07:18,198 --> 00:07:21,780
问我介不介意 当然是没问题啦
Is that okay? It's awesome.

177
00:07:21,780 --> 00:07:23,620
只希望你的女朋友不会介意啊
I hope your girlfriend didn't mind.

178
00:07:23,760 --> 00:07:24,740
我们刚分手
We just broke up.

179
00:07:24,780 --> 00:07:25,540
所以我现在是单身
So I'm single.

180
00:07:26,060 --> 00:07:26,980
我最好赶紧撤了
And I better get going.

181
00:07:27,020 --> 00:07:27,820
我十点钟有个会议
I've got a 10:00 meeting.

182
00:07:28,180 --> 00:07:29,120
麦克斯 把宠物拎包还人家
Max, give the man his case.

183
00:07:29,180 --> 00:07:30,460
他十点有个会议呢
He has a 10:00 meeting.

184
00:07:31,580 --> 00:07:33,340
她不想离开这个舒服的东西
She doesn't want to get out of cushy this thing.

185
00:07:33,420 --> 00:07:34,380
我完全懂她心情
I totally get it.

186
00:07:34,380 --> 00:07:36,020
我有一次坐到商场里的按摩椅上
I had to be dragged out of that massage chair

187
00:07:36,020 --> 00:07:37,560
最后也得是保安把我拉下来
at Brookstone by mall security.

188
00:07:38,520 --> 00:07:40,220
这是我的名片 你们要还包时
Well, here's my card, just give me a call

189
00:07:40,220 --> 00:07:41,180
打给我 我会来取
when you want me to pick up the case.

190
00:07:41,460 --> 00:07:42,920
你有名片吗
You have a card?

191
00:07:44,300 --> 00:07:47,020
名片 会议 西装 笑话
A card, a meeting, a suit, a joke?

192
00:07:47,040 --> 00:07:48,440
你是下一个要上《黄金单身汉》的人吗
Are you the next Bachelor?

193
00:07:50,280 --> 00:07:52,600
谢谢你 欧文·查尔斯·博伊得
Well, thank you, Owen Charles Boyd,

194
00:07:52,600 --> 00:07:54,340
带回我们亲爱的...
for bringing back our beloved--

195
00:07:54,340 --> 00:07:55,840
-她的名字叫南希 -我知道她名字
- Her name's Nancy! - I know her name.

196
00:07:56,000 --> 00:07:57,320
我为什么就一定要很快速念出来
Why do I have to say it so fast?

197
00:07:58,720 --> 00:08:01,140
她是在开玩笑 只是她没你这么好笑
She's joking, she's just not as funny as you.

198
00:08:02,080 --> 00:08:03,180
好吧 很高兴认识你
Well, it was nice to meet you.

199
00:08:03,560 --> 00:08:04,060
再见啦 南希
Bye, Nancy.

200
00:08:05,420 --> 00:08:05,860
好吧
Okay.

201
00:08:12,320 --> 00:08:13,780
是的 我的确是在调情
Yes, I was flirting.

202
00:08:13,780 --> 00:08:15,520
但我是为了我们的生意啊
But I was doing it for our business.

203
00:08:15,680 --> 00:08:17,640
你真的应该为你下面的"生意"而调情
You should really be doing it for your business.

204
00:08:18,880 --> 00:08:20,340
因为你的"生意"就快关门大吉了
'Cause your business is going out of business.

205
00:08:21,440 --> 00:08:22,560
他有张名片[卡]
He has a card.

206
00:08:22,580 --> 00:08:24,420
而且不是医用大麻的卡
And it's not for medical marijuana.

207
00:08:24,960 --> 00:08:26,220
他是个风险投资人
He's a venture capitalist.

208
00:08:26,320 --> 00:08:27,500
这种待宰肥猫
That's the kind of fat cat

209
00:08:27,500 --> 00:08:29,040
正是能让我们生意重回正轨的人
that can help us get back on our feet.

210
00:08:29,340 --> 00:08:31,040
说到肥猫 南希看起来
Speaking of fat cats, Nancy's looking like

211
00:08:31,040 --> 00:08:32,500
像是需要给肥珍打个电话了
she might need to give Jenny a call.

212
00:08:33,316 --> 00:08:35,840
姑娘们
Hey, girls.

213
00:08:35,840 --> 00:08:37,480
你们找到南希啦
Oh, you found Nancy.

214
00:08:38,460 --> 00:08:40,380
我就知道她会大着肚子回来
I knew she'd come back pregnant.

215
00:08:42,180 --> 00:08:43,860
等等 苏菲 你怎么知道她怀孕了
Wait, Sophie, how can you tell she's pregnant

216
00:08:43,860 --> 00:08:46,340
而不是只是跟小胖仔乔纳·希尔有一样的问题
and just not fighting the same battle Jonah Hill is fighting?

217
00:08:47,620 --> 00:08:50,940
她毛厚了 眼里也多出了些光芒
Well, her fur is thicker, she's got a little sparkle in her eye,

218
00:08:51,160 --> 00:08:53,460
而且小猫的头都要从她洞里探出来了
and there's a little kitten head about to pop out of her patoot.

219
00:09:01,960 --> 00:09:03,880
加油 用力 南希
Come on. Push, Nancy.

220
00:09:04,660 --> 00:09:05,840
我们都知道你干了什么好事
Come on, we all know what you did.

221
00:09:06,680 --> 00:09:08,660
现在不是你害羞的时间
Now is not the time to be shy.

222
00:09:10,280 --> 00:09:12,020
苏菲 你是真懂你在做的这件事吧
You do know what you're doing, right, Sophie?

223
00:09:12,200 --> 00:09:13,520
而不是像你上次跟我们说
This isn't like the time you told us

224
00:09:13,520 --> 00:09:15,500
你知道怎么用蜡烛来做私处除毛一样
you could do your own bikini wax with a candle?

225
00:09:17,060 --> 00:09:19,440
因为那香草味蜡油疤还没消呢
'Cause I still have the vanilla-scented scars from that.

226
00:09:20,540 --> 00:09:21,460
不用担心
Don't worry.

227
00:09:22,120 --> 00:09:24,860
在我老家村里 科臣斯基家的女人
In my village, all the Kuchenskis women

228
00:09:24,860 --> 00:09:26,300
都得当动物的产婆
acted as animal midwives.

229
00:09:26,520 --> 00:09:28,400
这也是认识男人最好的方法了
It was the best way to meet guys.

230
00:09:29,580 --> 00:09:30,482
屏息以待 姑娘们
Strap in, girls.

231
00:09:30,482 --> 00:09:33,409
小猫的头要出来了
She's crowning!

232
00:09:33,880 --> 00:09:35,320
我真不敢相信
I can't believe it.

233
00:09:35,500 --> 00:09:37,640
我一直以为南希没这么傻
I thought Nancy was smarter than this.

234
00:09:37,760 --> 00:09:39,440
但结果发现 她跟我家族里的其他女人
But it turns out she's just like the rest of the women

235
00:09:39,440 --> 00:09:40,360
没啥不同
in my family.

236
00:09:41,220 --> 00:09:43,420
都是被垃圾堆认识的陌生人给搞了
Screwed by some stranger she met in the dumpster.

237
00:09:44,860 --> 00:09:46,640
好了 来啦
Okay, here we go.

238
00:09:49,400 --> 00:09:51,300
我的戒指再见了
Oh, there goes my ring.

239
00:09:52,844 --> 00:09:55,982
抱歉啊 南希
I--sorry, Nancy.

240
00:09:56,460 --> 00:09:57,560
来啦
Oh, here we go!

241
00:09:57,800 --> 00:10:00,880
快点 姑娘们 我需要热水跟干净的毛巾
Come on, girls, I need some hot water and fresh towels.

242
00:10:02,040 --> 00:10:04,200
我们也需要啊 等了有四年了
We do, too. For, like, four years.

243
00:10:05,900 --> 00:10:06,880
这些T恤拿去用怎么样
How about some of these T-shirts?

244
00:10:07,800 --> 00:10:09,340
是啊 干嘛不用呢
Oh, sure why not use those?

245
00:10:09,400 --> 00:10:10,740
它们曾经代表着我们的美好未来
They used to be our bright future.

246
00:10:10,740 --> 00:10:13,300
现在成了私生猫的超吸水毛巾了
Now just a ShamWow for illegitimate cats.

247
00:10:16,960 --> 00:10:21,020
天啊 这大概就是猫子宫缴械投降的声音吧
Oh, my God, that must be the sound of a surrendering cat uterus.

248
00:10:22,560 --> 00:10:24,480
这是好久以来那张床上
Well, it's the first time a uterus has surrendered

249
00:10:24,480 --> 00:10:25,580
第一次有子宫缴械投降吧
in that bed in a while.

250
00:10:29,500 --> 00:10:32,300
我不知道我为什么看到不会想吐
I don't know why I'm not throwing up.

251
00:10:32,380 --> 00:10:34,060
等等 吐意上来了
Oh, wait. I'm starting to.

252
00:10:37,580 --> 00:10:40,460
我这辈子再也不敢直视韩式饺子了
Well, I'm off Korean dumplings for life.

253
00:10:41,440 --> 00:10:43,800
这只 这只不愿意出来[出柜]
This one-- this one won't come out.

254
00:10:43,840 --> 00:10:47,080
就像猫界的奎因·莱提法
It's like the Queen Latifah of kittens.

255
00:10:50,560 --> 00:10:54,120
苏菲 我收到你的短信说你跟南希在床上
Sophie, I got your text that you were in bed with Nancy.

256
00:10:54,840 --> 00:10:56,300
谁是南希
Who is this Nancy,

257
00:10:56,400 --> 00:10:57,780
我们什么时候回去搞三人行
and when did we go back to doing three-ways?

258
00:11:00,240 --> 00:11:01,660
南希是只猫
Nancy's a cat.

259
00:11:02,940 --> 00:11:04,000
这我不行
Mm, that's a no.

260
00:11:05,200 --> 00:11:07,020
没节操也得有个底线吧
I've got to draw the line somewhere.

261
00:11:13,220 --> 00:11:15,680
我听说了
Well, I heard the news.

262
00:11:15,840 --> 00:11:18,660
你们俩没到30岁就当上外婆了
Looks like you two are grandmothers before you're 30.

263
00:11:19,980 --> 00:11:21,580
我一点也不意外
Can't say I'm surprised.

264
00:11:23,960 --> 00:11:26,180
行了 不用问了
Okay, before you even ask,

265
00:11:26,220 --> 00:11:28,400
你们没有带薪陪猫产假
I don't pay for cat maternity leave.

266
00:11:28,560 --> 00:11:29,680
这里又不是谷歌公司
This isn't Google.

267
00:11:31,420 --> 00:11:33,540
这里连金点子公司都算不上 阿憨
This isn't even Ask Jeeves, Han.

268
00:11:35,940 --> 00:11:38,960
我可以帮你们为小猫找到好的领养家庭
Well, I can help you get the kittens good homes.

269
00:11:39,080 --> 00:11:41,340
我楼里的人们都非常友好
The people in my building are very nice.

270
00:11:41,540 --> 00:11:44,900
除非你忘了回收一个苹果气泡酒的瓶子
Except if you don't recycle one bottle of sparkling cider,

271
00:11:45,080 --> 00:11:46,780
那坐电梯的时候就没人鸟你了
then nobody talks to you in the elevator.

272
00:11:48,100 --> 00:11:49,760
阿憨 我们不会把小猫送走
Han, we're not giving the kittens away.

273
00:11:49,760 --> 00:11:51,920
南希傍上了一只有钱猫
Nancy landed herself a rich cat,

274
00:11:52,000 --> 00:11:54,280
我们以后就靠丰厚的小猫抚养费过活啦
we're gonna be living off a hefty kitty support.

275
00:11:55,440 --> 00:11:57,360
这种事只有你们俩才做得出来
Only you two would be desperate enough

276
00:11:57,360 --> 00:11:59,280
跑去找一只干爹猫
to try and find a sugar catty.

277
00:12:00,800 --> 00:12:02,320
欧文有回你电话吗
So has Owen called you back yet?

278
00:12:02,920 --> 00:12:03,740
我们还在约
Um, we're trading.

279
00:12:04,800 --> 00:12:05,640
"我们还在约"
"We're trading"?

280
00:12:06,100 --> 00:12:08,280
寂寞白妞才会打这种官腔
"We're trading" is lonely white girl talk

281
00:12:08,280 --> 00:12:09,420
意思是"他没有回我电话"
for "he hasn't called me back."

282
00:12:10,000 --> 00:12:12,060
真是不敢相信 他是一个不负责任的老爹
I can't believe this. He's a deadbeat dad.

283
00:12:13,240 --> 00:12:14,460
麦克斯 他只是很忙
Max, he's just busy.

284
00:12:14,460 --> 00:12:17,380
我想你可能因为你爸 所以觉得天下乌鸦一般黑
And I think you might be projecting a little because of your dad.

285
00:12:17,380 --> 00:12:18,620
并不是说我是心理医生
Not that I'm a therapist.

286
00:12:18,780 --> 00:12:19,965
拜托 我连给病人坐的沙发都买不起
I mean, I can't even afford a couch.

287
00:12:19,965 --> 00:12:22,460
我才没有呢
I'm not projecting.

288
00:12:22,460 --> 00:12:25,060
一般见不着鬼影的都是不负责任的老爹
I just know a deadbeat dad when I don't see one!

289
00:12:25,960 --> 00:12:26,960
他的名片在哪里
Where's his card?

290
00:12:27,160 --> 00:12:28,480
我不记得我放哪里了
I don't remember where I--

291
00:12:28,480 --> 00:12:30,720
麦克斯 放手 我能搞定
Max, let go! I've got this.

292
00:12:30,920 --> 00:12:32,940
那个家伙真的能帮我们的生意一把
That guy can really help us with our business.

293
00:12:33,040 --> 00:12:34,480
拜托 让我处理吧
Please, let me handle this.

294
00:12:34,600 --> 00:12:35,420
快看 帅气高司令来了
Look, Ryan Gosling.

295
00:12:37,960 --> 00:12:39,240
-我来 -我来
- I got this. - I got this.

296
00:12:39,240 --> 00:12:40,480
-我来 -我来
- I got this. - I got this.

297
00:12:40,480 --> 00:12:42,100
继续 姑娘们 我快"来"了
Keep going, girls, I'm almost there.

298
00:12:44,660 --> 00:12:46,000
我来 麦克斯
I got this, Max.

299
00:12:46,060 --> 00:12:47,720
等他过来拿宠物拎包时
And when he comes to get the cat carrier,

300
00:12:47,740 --> 00:12:48,740
我会跟他谈
I'll talk to him.

301
00:12:48,940 --> 00:12:50,160
你现在太激动了
You're way too emotional.

302
00:12:50,220 --> 00:12:52,180
刚才都跟我的围裙到第三垒了
You just went to third base with my apron.

303
00:12:58,260 --> 00:12:59,920
在前门楼梯坐着感觉挺好
Sitting on this stoop is nice.

304
00:13:00,040 --> 00:13:01,720
为什么我们从来不出来坐呢
How come we never sit out here?

305
00:13:05,580 --> 00:13:06,500
这就是原因
There it is.

306
00:13:07,900 --> 00:13:08,820
拜托 那是里克啦
Oh, please, it's just Rico.

307
00:13:12,640 --> 00:13:14,800
里克看起来挺好 好像多了一个纹身
Rico looks good. I think he got another tattoo.

308
00:13:16,440 --> 00:13:18,840
听着 当欧文来了 我们应该还活着
Look, when Owen gets here, should we still be alive,

309
00:13:19,120 --> 00:13:20,700
拜托让我跟他谈
please let me do the talking.

310
00:13:21,100 --> 00:13:23,020
撇开小猫不说 欧文能帮我们
Kittens aside, Owen can help us.

311
00:13:23,300 --> 00:13:24,800
风险投资人专门买公司
A venture capitalist buys companies

312
00:13:24,800 --> 00:13:25,940
然后让它们起死回生
and turns them around.

313
00:13:26,040 --> 00:13:27,120
知道 我看过《风月俏佳人》
Yeah, I've seen Pretty Woman.

314
00:13:28,680 --> 00:13:30,340
那令我意识到我当时要价太少了
That's how I realized I wasn't charging enough.

315
00:13:31,300 --> 00:13:32,320
快走 麦克斯 他来了
Go, Max, here he comes.

316
00:13:32,780 --> 00:13:35,060
好啦 但我会从里面的窗户监视你
All right, but I'll be watching inside from the window.

317
00:13:35,740 --> 00:13:36,460
这样或许更好
It's probably better,

318
00:13:36,460 --> 00:13:38,060
因为我不放心让南希单独和小猫们一起
because I don't trust Nancy alone with those kittens.

319
00:13:38,140 --> 00:13:39,600
她有严重的产后抑郁
She's got some serious postpartum.

320
00:13:39,880 --> 00:13:41,900
当我离开房间时 她用颤抖的猫爪
When I left the room, she was lighting a Menthol 100

321
00:13:41,900 --> 00:13:43,100
点了一根薄荷烟
with a shaky paw.

322
00:13:46,080 --> 00:13:46,520
你好啊
Hi.

323
00:13:47,160 --> 00:13:49,340
咱俩原来住得这么近啊 走路就能到
Crazy we live walking distance from each other.

324
00:13:49,500 --> 00:13:50,060
并没有
We don't.

325
00:13:50,220 --> 00:13:52,640
出租豪车司机不愿意开过拐角那个消防栓
The Uber driver wouldn't go past the fire hydrant on the corner.

326
00:13:53,180 --> 00:13:54,960
那个挂有一只血鞋子的消防栓吗
The one with the bloody shoe hanging from it?

327
00:13:55,020 --> 00:13:55,880
就是那个
That's the one.

328
00:13:58,360 --> 00:14:00,280
算了 我还是拿了宠物包快走吧
You know what? I'm just gonna take the cat carrier.

329
00:14:00,420 --> 00:14:01,840
先等等
Before you go...

330
00:14:04,000 --> 00:14:06,100
我们有一家小蛋糕店
we have this small cupcake company

331
00:14:06,100 --> 00:14:07,820
祈求成为小蛋糕帝国
that's just begging to be an empire,

332
00:14:07,820 --> 00:14:10,200
我想向你讨教一些生意上的事情
and I wanted to pick your brain about some business stuff.

333
00:14:16,380 --> 00:14:19,180
好吧 你的狄更斯把我们的猫肚子搞大了
Okay, so your Dickens got our cat pregnant,

334
00:14:19,180 --> 00:14:21,020
她刚生下了五只小猫
and she just had five kittens.

335
00:14:21,400 --> 00:14:24,024
以她的年纪 我们不用花钱去做试管真是奇迹啊
And at her age, it's a miracle we didn't have to pay for in vitro.

336
00:14:24,024 --> 00:14:26,500
你怎么知道就是狄更斯的
How do you know they are Dickens's?

337
00:14:26,500 --> 00:14:27,800
我不是说南希放荡
I'm not saying that Nancy's easy,

338
00:14:27,800 --> 00:14:30,240
只是我见过她在很多窗户进进出出
it's just, I've seen her go in and out of a lot of windows.

339
00:14:35,340 --> 00:14:36,780
他刚是掉了一把枪吗
Did he just drop a gun?

340
00:14:37,380 --> 00:14:38,580
没关系 他还有更多
It's fine. He has more.

341
00:14:39,800 --> 00:14:41,720
好吧 给我助理打电话 你可以向我讨教[大脑]
Okay, call my assistant, you can pick my brain.

342
00:14:41,820 --> 00:14:43,700
我不想它[脑浆]飞溅出人行道
